OL,5,G1900 World War I in Colour
OL,6,     FWartime misery has penetrated
OL,7,     Fevery home, affecting every aspect
OL,8,     Fof daily life. A solution must be
OL,9,     Ffound to end the war.
OL,10,G2000 How the Nazis Lost the War
OL,11,     FAs Germany's resources dwindled,
OL,12,     FHitler and Goebbels promoted
OL,13,     FWonder Weapons as a path to
OL,14,     Fvictory. However, this blind
OL,15,     Fbelief in technology became a
OL,16,     Fmajor hindrance to the Nazi war
OL,17,     Feffort.
